sumi
The engine mirin Metal draws with (https://github.com/Netko-Labs/mirin).

This product includes software developed by Zed Industries, Inc.

sumi derives from the GPUI crates of the Zed repository
(https://github.com/zed-industries/zed) as they were at commit
703b5ac3f4ffe1e87a073123ae56e22f72f095c4 (2026-11-14), which are licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE). The files have been
changed by the mirin project: the crates were moved and renamed (gpui is
sumi, gpui_<x> is sumi-<x>), cut to what mirin Metal calls, and changed
since. MIRIN.md lists the changes up to that commit, PICKS.md what was taken
from Zed after it, and the git history the rest. The changes are under the
same license.

Zed's repository carries no NOTICE file of its own.
